            "type": "custom_html",
            "html": "<div class=\"content-block\" style=\"padding:0;margin:0;\">\n  <div style=\"width:100vw;flex-shrink:0;margin-left:calc(-50vw + 50%);background:#f8fafc;padding:96px 0;min-height:70vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;text-align:center;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;\">\n\n      <svg width=\"132\" height=\"132\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Smiling face\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto 28px;\">\n        <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"46\" fill=\"#fde047\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"35\" cy=\"40\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#111827\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"65\" cy=\"40\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#111827\"/>\n        <path d=\"M28 60 Q50 82 72 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n\n      <p style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:0 0 6px;word-break:break-all;\">{business_domain}</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem;color:#374151;margin:0 0 2px;\">{business}</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:.95rem;color:#6b7280;margin:0 0 28px;\">{city_state}</p>\n\n      <div style=\"display:inline-block;text-align:left;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:.8rem;color:#6b7280;line-height:1.9;\">\n        <div>built <strong style=\"color:#111827;\">{built_at}</strong></div>\n        <div>phone <strong style=\"color:#111827;\">{phone}</strong> &middot; email <strong style=\"color:#111827;\">{email}</strong></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#9ca3af;margin:26px 0 0;\">\n        Pipeline smoke test. If you can read this, the vhost, the upload and the token\n        substitution all worked &mdash; and the domain above proves this content reached\n        the folder it was meant for.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
